tle=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Epic_Headman%27s_Hood.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Epic_Headman%27s_Hood.png/420px-Epic_Headman%27s_Hood.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"391\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Epic_Headman%27s_Hood.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>A dirty cloth hood spattered with blood. It stinks of old sweat and gives off an aura of palpable fear.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817205050\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.090 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.212 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3677/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28746/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8282/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n162.79%  310.453     50 Template:IO\n100.00%  190.702      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  190.702      1 -total\n 97.28%  185.523      1 Template:Named_